the **LU decomposition with partial pivoting** of a matrix
:math:`A \in \mathbb{K}^{m \times n}` is defined as

.. math::

    A = PLU\mathrlap{\qquad P \in \mathbb{K}^{m \times m}, L \in \mathbb{K}^{m \times k}, U \in \mathbb{K}^{k \times n}}

